    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of a curious cat in this charming, nature-inspired adventure!<br>Explore three colorful worlds,\u00a0each of them being different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feline hero loves to jump, catch birds and navigate the environment with agility, all while evading obstacles, animals and solving simple puzzles along the way.<br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It's a relaxing and fun game, full of charm and surprises!<br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><br>- Simple &amp; intuitive gameplay <br>- Cute birds and animals <br>- Colorful and charming graphics<br> - Three different Worlds each having 10 levels <br>- Cat skins to customize your character <br>-\u00a0Steam achievements <br>- Beautiful music</p>",
